%% UI owners: src/pages/message-v3/service/ipcEventHandler.service.ts::handlePostUpdated；src/pages/message-v3/service/messageNotice.service.ts::createTodoListData
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as Angular UI
  participant Gate as MessageV3 Gate Port
  participant Native as Tauri Native
  participant FFI as Flutter FFI
  participant Web as Browser Web
  participant E as ExecutionShell Tick
  participant IM as helix-im
  participant Host as driver-host
  participant DB as tenant SQLite
  participant Go as Go IM Server
  participant WS as WS inbound
  participant Sink as EventSink raw bytes
  Note over UI,Gate: 用户目标：成员点「已读」确认加急后，待办里那条转为完成态而不是多出一条
  Note over UI,Web: 当前覆盖状态：mock=partial；helix=partial；dual=yes；personaLocal=yes；该图是交互合同，不把 Mock、HTTP 2xx 或静态注册写成真实 Green
  alt PC Tauri 入口
    UI->>Gate: confirmUrgent + queryTodoList(payload)
    Gate->>Native: invokeAccepted("im_urgent_confirm + im_query_todo_list", payload)
    Native->>E: Tick::Command(AppCommand)
  else Flutter FFI 入口
    FFI->>E: helix_command("im_urgent_confirm + im_query_todo_list", payload)
  else Browser Web 入口
    Web->>E: invoke("im_urgent_confirm + im_query_todo_list", payload)
  end
  E->>IM: ExecutionShell::step(Tick::Command)
  IM->>IM: 校验 加急确认后更新待办状态 的入参，生成 corr_key/req_id
  IM->>Host: Effect::Http 复用 Phase 1 urgent confirm 端点 + POST /posts/queryTodoList
  Host->>Go: HTTP request with tenant/auth/corr headers
  Go-->>Host: HTTP response（2xx 只代表 admission/query response）
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(http)
  E->>IM: correlate req_id/corr_key
  IM-->>E: Command Result {data}
  E-->>Gate: PortReply(Result)
  Gate-->>UI: render absolute snapshot or query result
  alt HTTP / PortReply / Persist error
    IM->>IM: keep prior durable state；attach structured error to corr_key
    IM-->>E: Err or correlated error result
    E-->>Gate: controlled failure
    Gate-->>UI: error / empty state；不得伪造成功事件
  end
  Note over IM,DB: 关键效果：确认者侧派发 UPDATE_TODO_ITEMid: $message.id_expedite, update: channel, post, type: 'expedite', canDel: true：按同 id 更新而非新增；更新后 canDel 变为 true（已确认的加急可被清除），与 G15a 的 canDel=false 形成状态迁移闭环
  Note over UI,Web: 关键负向：不得新建第二条待办：必须按同 id（$message.id_expedite）更新，出现两条即契约破损；同一条消息不得同时产出 SEND_TODO_LIST_DATA 与 UPDATE_TODO_ITEM（status 0 与 1 互斥，isUnReadExpedite 与 isReadExpedite 不可同真）
  Note over E,Sink: 出站事件集合：无业务事件；跨端只搬运 {event,data} 原始字节，不在 shell 复制 reducer
